      "statement": "FI-US-MUNI-CREDIT Edition 2025-06 is marked current and not re-issued since publication; it moved US municipal credit from neutral to overweight, expressed as a two-to-four-percentage-point taxable-fixed-income-sleeve increase concentrated in high-yield and lower-investment-grade private-activity bonds and funded from investment-grade corporate credit, and it applies to positions taken on or after 2025-07-01.",
